# CI/CD Adapter

- Provider: {{provider}}
- CI triggers: pull request and pushes to test/production branches.
- CI responsibilities: clean install, static checks, tests, build once, publish immutable artifact.
- Test CD: deploy the CI artifact first, run independent integration acceptance, then publish a digest-bound test receipt.
- Production CD: promote the identical approved artifact from protected production branch.
- Provider files: keep CI verification/publication and CD promotion as separate workflows. CD accepts an immutable artifact digest and never rebuilds source.
- Provider preflight receipt SHA-256: {{provider_preflight_receipt_sha256}}
- Provider preflight observed at: {{provider_preflight_observed_at}}
- Repository identity: {{repository_identity}}
- Effective branch protection / ruleset: {{effective_branch_protection_or_ruleset}}
- Required status checks: {{required_status_checks}}
- Production environment required reviewers: {{production_environment_required_reviewers}}
- Approved production decision packet SHA-256: {{production_decision_packet_sha256}}
- Required approvals: {{approvals}}
- Secrets source: {{secret_provider}}
- Rollback: {{rollback}}
